        <!-- 6. BOTTOM BANNER: AWS CLOUDFORMATION IaC, CI/CD & DISASTER RECOVERY (V5 CloudOps) -->
        <mxCell id="cfn_banner" value="AWS CLOUDFORMATION IaC &amp; CLOUDOPS GOVERNANCE (infra/cloudformation/template.yaml  •  GitHub Actions CI + cfn-lint)&#xa;• 100% Reproducible Stack (S3, SQS + DLQ, IAM, Redshift Serverless, CloudWatch Alarms, SNS, AWS Budgets)  |  Native Auto-Rollback on Failure&#xa;• Conditional FinOps Toggle (DeployRedshift=true/false for $0 Free-Tier Testing)  |  Operations Runbook (Recovery Point Restore, S3 Archive Replay, DLQ Redrive &amp; 100% Clean-up)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;sketch=1;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#C62828;fillColor=#FFEBEE;fontColor=#B71C1C;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
